<titlePage type="main"><milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<docTitle><titlePart type="main"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#g">METRA EXSEQUIALIA,</hi></hi></titlePart><lb/>
<titlePart type="desc"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Quibus</hi><lb/>
Manes Pios Memoriamq&#x0300;; Beatam<lb/>
<hi rendition="#i">Venerabilis &amp; Doctißimi Viri,</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#g">Dn. JOANNIS<lb/>
SWANENGELII<lb/>
HORENSOMMER-<lb/>
DENSIS,</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#i">Pa&#x017F;toris Eccle&#x017F;iæ Oldislebien&#x017F;is, annorum<lb/>
triginta decursù, vigilantißimi,</hi><lb/>
ad D. 14. Maji A. S. &#x221E; &#x217C;&#x2184;&#x217D; XVII.<lb/>
<hi rendition="#i">piè in Dominô demortui,<lb/>
quantulôcun&#xA759; &#x017F;tudiô.</hi></hi></titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<byline><hi rendition="#aq">Ab </hi><docAuthor><hi rendition="#aq">Amicis &amp; Fautoribus</hi></docAuthor><hi rendition="#aq">.</hi></byline><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<docImprint><pubPlace><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#i">JENÆ,</hi></hi></hi></pubPlace><lb/>
<publisher><hi rendition="#aq">Typis Johannis VVeidneri</hi></publisher><hi rendition="#aq">, Anno</hi> <docDate>1617</docDate>.</docImprint></titlePage></front><body><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0002" n="[52]"/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div type="fsEpicedia" n="1"><head/>  <milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div n="2"><head/>  <lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#in">S</hi><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#g">CHWANENGELII</hi> eras: verè tibi nomen utrum&#xA759;&#x0301;</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Competit, &amp; gemini nominis omen habes</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Cygnus eras, &#x017F;ed qui vivus moriens&#xA759;&#x0301; benignum</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Voce tua poteras commemorare Deum.</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Candidior nive Cygnus eras: tua pectora fraudis</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Ne&#x017F;cia; quidquid eras non ni&#x017F;i candor eras.</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Aligeri nomen &#x017F;ed cur fecêre Mini&#x017F;tri?</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Cur? his cum geniis quod tibi munus idem.</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Nuncia ferre Dei no&#x017F;træ re&#x017F;pon&#x017F;a &#x017F;alutis,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Hæc fuit, hæc vitæ cura fides&#xA759;&#x0301; tuæ.</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Jam recinis &#x017F;ummi genitoris in æthere laudes</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Angelus &amp; Cygnus, quæ cupis omne capis.</hi></hi></l></lg><lb/>
<closer><salute><hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#aq">VVolffgang Heider M.</hi></hi></salute></closer></div><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">In Obitum</hi><lb/>
Reverendi &amp; Humani&#x017F;simi Viri,<lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">Dn. JOHANNIS</hi></hi> <hi rendition="#b">Schwan-</hi><lb/>
Engell <hi rendition="#aq">Pa&#x017F;toris apud Oldislebien&#x017F;es vigi-<lb/>
lanti&#x017F;simi &amp; digni&#x017F;simi, quondam Amici<lb/>
&#x017F;ui plurimum amandi.</hi></head><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#in">Q</hi><hi rendition="#i">Ui&#xA759;&#x0301; Sacerdotes ca&#x017F;ti dum vita manebat:</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Omnibus, bis niveâ cinguntur tempora vittâ,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#aq">Virgilius</hi></fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0003" n="[53]"/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Virgilius fatur. Tua &#x017F;ed quâ tempora vittâ,</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Cincta SchwanEngeli, mors quando lumina clau&#x017F;it</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Atq; his à terris &#x017F;uperas deduxit ad ædeis<hi rendition="#i">?</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Angelus &amp; Cygnus dederant tibi nomina, &amp; nullus</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Hæreo, quin Cygnus veluti e&#x017F;t albedine tinctus</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Omneis per parteis, tua &#x017F;ic quoq tempora vittâ</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Ornavit nive â inq&#x0301;; &#x017F;inum portavit Abrahæ</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Angelus. Hinc curæ ce&#x017F;&#x017F;ant, &amp; gaudia cre&#x017F;cunt,</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Gaudia, Mortalis quæ nunquam vidit ocellus,</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq">Gaudia, Mortalis quæ capta nec auribus unquam.</hi></l></lg><lb/>
<closer><salute><hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">M. MichaelVVolfius, Phy-<lb/>
&#x017F;ices Prof. Pub. in Acad. Jen.</hi></hi></hi></salute></closer></div><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div n="2"><head><hi rendition="#aq">Threnodia funebris, &#x017F;eu epi-<lb/>
taphium dicatum memoriæ Reverendi,<lb/>
pietate, eruditione, doctrina morumq; venu&#x017F;tate Or-<lb/>
nati&#x017F;simi Viri, Dn. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k">Johannis Schwanengels</hi></hi><lb/>
Pa&#x017F;toris olim in Oldisleben fideli&#x017F;simi &amp; digni&#x017F;simi<lb/>
fautoris, amici, vicini &amp; confratris in Chri&#x017F;to ca-<lb/>
ri&#x017F;simi &amp; de&#x017F;iderati&#x017F;simi, aut. M. <hi rendition="#g"><hi rendition="#k">Nico-<lb/>
lao Eccardo.</hi></hi></hi></head><lb/>
<lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#in">Q</hi><hi rendition="#i">Ui tran&#x017F;is, paulum cur&#x017F;um mihi &#x017F;i&#x017F;te, viator,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Et cinis ad cineres officio&#x017F;us ades.</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Qualis es, ip&#x017F;e fui, dum fata Deus&#xA759;&#x0301; &#x017F;inebant:</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Nunc ego &#x017F;um mer&#x017F;us funere, qualis eris.</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Olsleb Schwanengel cantavi verba &#x017F;alutis,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Verba mini&#x017F;terio tradita Chri&#x017F;te tuo.</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<fw place="bottom" type="sig"><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">G</hi> 3</hi></fw><fw place="bottom" type="catch"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Officii</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0004" n="[54]"/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Officii cur&#x017F;us ter denos continet annos</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Ast uno; duplo vita&#xA759; major erat,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Et quamvis populo vera pietate prairem,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Effugere haud potui tela cruenta necis.</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Ut Majus pulchro depinxerat omnia vultu,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Naturæ &#x017F;olvi debita ju&#x017F;ta &#x017F;uæ.</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Æternis olim cum pinxerit omnia majus</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Floribus. in florem &amp; induar ip&#x017F;e novum,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Æterni tumulô men&#x017F;es me &#x017F;cilicet i&#x017F;t hoc</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Elicient, Chri&#x017F;to tum veniente meo</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Quæ docui populum referam cum mercia ritæ.</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Hæc volui: benè tu nunc moriturus abi.</hi></hi></l></lg></div><lb/>
<div n="2"><head/>  <lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#fr"><hi rendition="#in">H</hi>Err Chri&#x017F;t hie lieget in der Erd/</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">Ein trewer Hirte deiner Hert/</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">Johann SchwanEngel ward genand/</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">Hie drei&#x017F;&#x017F;ig Jahr gfu&#x0364;hrt das Pfarrampt.</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">Laß jhn dermahl ho&#x0364;ren die Wort:</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">So du &#x017F;ag&#x017F;t beym Mattheo dort. c. 25.</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">Wolan/ kom her du trewer Knecht/</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">Du ha&#x017F;t dein Ampt verricht gar recht:</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">Weil du nun fleiß vnd trew erwie&#x017F;n/</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">Jn dem/ &#x017F;o dir befohln gewe&#x017F;n/</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">So wil ich dich &#x017F;etzn vber viel/</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">Geh in mein Reich/ das i&#x017F;t mein Will.</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">Diß wu&#x0364;n&#x017F;ch ich Eccard von Hertzn zwar/</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr">HErr Chri&#x017F;t machs an vns allen wahr.</hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#fr"><hi rendition="#g"> <space dim="horizontal"/> AMEN.</hi></hi></l></lg><lb/>
<closer><salute><hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#aq">Eodem authore.</hi></hi></salute></closer></div><lb/>
<fw type="catch" place="bottom"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">M&#x0153;chæ</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0005" n="[55]"/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div n="2"><head/>  <lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#in">M</hi><hi rendition="#i">Oechæ ADELHEIDIS quà &#x017F;unt uxoria clau&#x017F;tra,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Virgea quin pagi m&#x0153;nia ONESTER adit;</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Et moreris, &#x017F;enii cum SEXAGESIMA Bruma</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">PRIMA nive oppleret tempora curi gena;</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Frigora triginta, triginta cum&#xA759;&#x0301; Calores</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Vox Tua LYTRiotæ mite doceret epos;</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Pignora dein thalami &#x017F;exû potiore tuli&#x017F;&#x017F;es</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Quina; exin gnatam durimô agone uteri;</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Floriditate &#x017F;ua cùm, cuncta dome&#x017F;tica, obirent</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Munia, in ornatû ver&#x017F;icolore domûs;</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">At SCHWANENGELI, horarum quia momina currunt,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">ANGELICI exoras agmina Præ&#x017F;idii,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#g">CYGNUS</hi> &amp; in tabulis &#x017F;uprema noematæ dictas,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Invictum en vinount vota preces&#xA759;&#x0301; DEUM!</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">SCHWANENGEL &#x017F;atur hinc vitæ, &#x017F;atur at&#xA759; laborum,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">(Innuit ut pætriô Littera Stirps&#xA759;&#x0301; &#x017F;ono:)</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">SPE citius, currû Simeónis, celica templa</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Intrat, Abrahami devenit in&#xA759;&#x0301; &#x017F;inum</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Felix in terris, Felicior ultimô agone</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Summi nempe Boni &#x017F;ingula puncta meret!</hi></hi></l></lg><lb/>
<closer><salute><hi rendition="#et"><hi rendition="#aq">M. Samuel Gualtherus, Scholæ, in Fran-<lb/>
cohu&#x017F;iô Schwartzburgicô, Rector.</hi></hi></salute></closer></div><lb/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<div n="2"><head/>  <lg type="poem"><l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#in">A</hi><hi rendition="#i">H! Fama quàm prænuncia Funeris</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">lerris humandi tri&#x017F;ti&#x017F;onâ chely,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Vitæ amputa&#x017F;&#x017F;e quæ ferebat</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Stamina, &amp; enecui&#x017F;&#x017F;e Mortam</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">My&#x017F;ten, &#x017F;enantem Chri&#x017F;ti&#x017F;equo Gregi</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Almi <hi rendition="#g">JEHOVÆ</hi> celica dogmata,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Fervore mentis &#x017F;anctiore,</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Peniculô ac digiti Orthodoxô:</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">My&#x017F;ten, popellus cúi bene noverat</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#i"><hi rendition="#aq">Concreditas pol pectoris intimas</hi></hi></l><lb/>
<fw place="bottom" type="catch"><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Fibras,</hi></hi></fw><lb/>
<pb facs="#f0006" n="[56]"/>
<milestone rendition="#hr" unit="section"/><lb/>
<l><hi rendition="#aq"><hi rendition="#i">Fibras, &#x017F;ibi&#xA759;&#x0301; recreandas</hi></hi></l><lb/>
